{"name": "Bushi", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bushi</strong> is a free to play online arena shooter brawler with limitless movement, action packed melee and ranged combat, and customizable abilities and control the battle with your unique playstyle. Play alone, with friends, or against others online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bushi</strong> is currently in Beta. You may encounter bugs or unfinished features as we continue development. We plan to release new content and update the game frequently based on player feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548340/extras/09b0861f99d21eda3202436934c21afe.poster.avif?t=1784068106\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548340/extras/09b0861f99d21eda3202436934c21afe.webm?t=1784068106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Master Movement</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Movement is more than transportation, it's a weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Victory belongs to the warrior who uses their surrounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548340/extras/5cabc290558aaf5913196ab3d5dd9378.poster.avif?t=1784068106\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548340/extras/5cabc290558aaf5913196ab3d5dd9378.webm?t=1784068106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548340/extras/5cabc290558aaf5913196ab3d5dd9378.mp4?t=1784068106\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Precision Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every decision matters. Engage enemies with swift sword strikes and devastating heavy attacks. Pick off opponents from range using your bow. Dodge and outmaneuver your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548340/extras/6a47f1269cd1e9be4730f0a23a86a1ac.webp?t=1784068106\"/><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"167\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548340/extras/6a47f1269cd1e9be4730f0a23a86a1ac.poster.avif?t=1784068106\" width=\"130\"/></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Create Your Own Fighting Style</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your warrior with your chosen unique abilities. Modify your playstyle with runes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mix and match dozens of combinations to create unique strategies and discover powerful synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548340/extras/8b53f957a7a8aa522f9c924c82008260.poster.avif?t=1784068106\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548340/extras/8b53f957a7a8aa522f9c924c82008260.webm?t=1784068106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548340/extras/8b53f957a7a8aa522f9c924c82008260.mp4?t=1784068106\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Powerful Abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Harness a growing arsenal of unique abilities. Every ability can be modified with runes that dramatically alter its behavior, strengths, and weaknesses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548340/extras/60e0891a927ffe1f46cb280b07177ef2.poster.avif?t=1784068106\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548340/extras/60e0891a927ffe1f46cb280b07177ef2.webm?t=1784068106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548340/extras/60e0891a927ffe1f46cb280b07177ef2.mp4?t=1784068106\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Battle Across Beautiful Arenas</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight across handcrafted maps inspired by Japanese architecture and landscapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master every environment, learn advantageous positions, and use the terrain to gain the upper hand in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548340/extras/6ba79844cd7534485c097051edf05795.poster.avif?t=1784068106\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548340/extras/6ba79844cd7534485c097051edf05795.webm?t=1784068106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Multiple Ways To Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete in a variety of multiplayer modes including. Play with friends, challenge skilled players or play by yourself against challenging bots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548340/extras_big/934d6656f2aee6b9485a5eb5b936955e.webp?t=1784068106\" height=\"878\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548340/extras/934d6656f2aee6b9485a5eb5b936955e.avif?t=1784068106\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Join The Community</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bushi</strong> is actively developed with community feedback helping shape the future of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join our Discord to find players to team up with, participate in community events, report bugs, provide feedback, and help shape future updates <br/> </p> </div>", "short_desc": "Bushi is a fast-paced online arena shooter brawler. Glide through the arena with limitless movement and engage in action packed melee and ranged combat. Customize your abilities and control the battle with your unique playstyle. Play alone, with friends, or against fierce competitors online.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548340/7a8b41e591b7e04993805fa5ceda601cd85a6870/header.jpg?t=1784068106", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Arena Shooter", "Third-Person Shooter", "Archery", "Parkour", "PvE", "PvP"], "developers": "Afrowhale", "publishers": "Afrowhale", "release_date": "Mar 31, 2026", "price": "Free To Play", "appid": "1548340", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "31 March 2026 - Free To Play", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/Pcqu_5DC37A", "first_seen": 1774908000.0, "review_rank": 926}